    {
      "text": "he spake, and praised God, Luke 1:64. multitude of the heavenly host praising God, Luke 2:13. shepherds returned … praising God, Luke 2:20. disciples began to rejoice and praise God, Luke 19:37. Give God the praise: we know that this man is a sinner, John 9:24. loved the praise of men more than the praise of God, John 12:43. do that which is good, and thou shalt have praise, Rom. 13:3. To the praise of the glory of his grace, Eph. 1:6. if there be any praise, think on these things, Philip. 4:8 (A of F 1:13). let us offer the sacrifice of praise to God, Heb. 13:15. shew forth the praises of him who hath called you, 1 Pet. 2:9. Jesus Christ, to whom be praise and dominion, 1 Pet. 4:11. Praise our God, all ye his servants, Rev. 19:5.",
